	optdepends = flatpak: the Flathub tab — search, install and update Flatpaks
	optdepends = syn-update: update SynapseOS components through synpkg system
	optdepends = git: build packages from the AUR
	optdepends = base-devel: makepkg, for AUR builds
	optdepends = syntty>=0.1.0-27: terminal the GUI opens for a full system upgrade
	optdepends = foot: the same, on an install that predates syntty
